      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST SENATOR.\nMy lord, you have my voice to ’t. The fault’s\nBloody. ’Tis necessary he should die.\nNothing emboldens sin so much as mercy.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
