      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST SENATOR.\nIf, after two days’ shine, Athens contain thee,\nAttend our weightier judgment.\nAnd, not to swell our spirit,\nHe shall be executed presently.",
